    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Customer Support\n**Flow:** Webhook (auth) → Config → Validate → customer history lookup → duplicate guard → AI triage (structured output) → deterministic business rules → save (Mongo + Data Table) → customer reply / staff alert.\n\n**Extras:** 400 on invalid input, idempotency, repeat-contact & keyword escalation, fail-safe-to-human, SLA deadlines + 15-min SLA watchdog, resolve endpoint, global error alert.",
        "height": 164,
        "width": 672
      },
      "id": "ae1dfcfc-96fb-4d1d-8c73-410469df2bb1",
      "name": "Note - Overview",
